<title>JAPAN: Freddie Mac launches 10-yr global bonds--Goldman.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac launches 10-yr global bonds--Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac) on Tuesday launched $500 million worth of 10-year global bonds due on January 5, 2007, one of the lead managers, Goldman Sachs, said.</p>
<p>The bonds will be priced 21 basis points over the yield of the 10-year Treasury note later today during New York trading hours.</p>
<p>The coupon payment dates are on January 5 and July 5.</p>
<p>The payment date will be on January 14.</p>
<p>The other lead manager is Nomura Securities.</p>
</text>
